  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg1Vj4ZUauQ4qtWr1b7J0H9Afz3ULclCGvvrOy3OcHGSizSQ5ej_Ce0LUa4epX2gUWm3bj-9S_RQWfVBLVZMFGFuNKy2qfJb1WF5cHcjL7vBUNydDfDv1Q7NrMwafhOjXihOYpdjquJMouH_whKXE_MI23iBmRy9O6mlNJXDE-3IycG6ux9QsoLjjECPV4/s1024/Designer%20-%202025-02-06T150243.257.jpeg\"><img alt=\"גבר מחויט נעמד ממושב הקהל באולם בית המשפט ומנופף ידיו בהתלהבות\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg1Vj4ZUauQ4qtWr1b7J0H9Afz3ULclCGvvrOy3OcHGSizSQ5ej_Ce0LUa4epX2gUWm3bj-9S_RQWfVBLVZMFGFuNKy2qfJb1WF5cHcjL7vBUNydDfDv1Q7NrMwafhOjXihOYpdjquJMouH_whKXE_MI23iBmRy9O6mlNJXDE-3IycG6ux9QsoLjjECPV4/w320-h320/Designer%20-%202025-02-06T150243.257.jpeg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כוכב צדק</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאֵלֶּה הַמִּשְׁפָּטִים</span></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יֵשׁ לִי חֲלוֹם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִלְמֹד מִשְׁפָּטִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּלַהַט וְחֹם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לַעֲרֹךְ דִּינִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְיַצֵּג בְּאֹפֶן יִצּוּגִי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהַנְחוֹת חֶבֶר מֻשְׁבָּעִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהַשְׁפִּיעַ בְּתִחְכּוּם שְׂפָתִי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהַרְשִׁים אֶת השׁוֹפְטִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנִי טוֹב בַּהֲגַנּוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַךְ אֶשְׂמַח גַּם לִתְבֹּעַ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהַפְרִיךְ עֵדוּיוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲמִתּוֹת לִקְבֹּעַ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִבְּחִינָתִי, יִקֹּב הַדִּין,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲפִלּוּ אֶת הָהָר.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֶפָּרַע מִכָּל מַקְצִין,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֵהַיָּם עַד הַנָּהָר.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תְּנוּ לִי גְּלִימָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שְׁחֹרָה כְּמוֹ עוֹרֵב.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאִם תִּתְּנוּ לִי בָּמָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְעוֹלָם אֵינִי עוֹזֵב.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנִי נִרְגָּשׁ לַהֲגוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֶת הַמִּלָּה 'כְּבוֹדוֹ'.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהַגִּישׁ הִתְנַגְּדוּיוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קָבַל עוֹלָם וּמְלוֹאוֹ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יֵשׁ לִי וִיבְּרַצְיָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְגַם סַעֲרַת רְגָשׁוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִבִּצּוּעַ לִיטִיגַצְיָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּכָל הָעַרְכָּאוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כֻּלָּם פִּתְּחוּ שְׁרִירִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">- אֲנִי, אֶת חוּשׁ הַצֶּדֶק.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הֵם כְּרִישִׁים שְׁלֵוִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">- אֲנִי, מְשַׁחֵר לַטֶּרֶף.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זֶה כֹּה נָעִים לִדְרֹךְ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַל גְּוִיּוֹת בַּדֶּרֶךְ לְצֶדֶק.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִרְמֹס וְגַם לִמְעֹךְ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְפַשְׁפֵּשׁ בְּכָל סֶדֶק.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יוֹם קַבָּלַת הַתֹּאַר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יְהֵא הַמְּאֻשָּׁר בְּחַיַּי.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֶתְעַטֵּף בְּאִצְטְלַת טֹהַר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַצְמִית אֶת מִתְנַגְּדַי.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַךְ סְלִיחָה שֶׁאֲנִי מַפְסִיק,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַמָּשׁ בְּאֶמְצַע הָאֶקְשֶׁן.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נִתְקַפְתִּי טוֹרְט מֵעִיק,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִצְעֹק עַכְשָׁו אובג'קשׁן...</span></p>"
}
